# === Run with (job-layout v1) ===
# Run from this directory -- all outputs share the SystemLabel basename below.
#     mpirun -np 4 siesta < siesta-stage3.fdf > siesta-stage3.out
# Stage 3 of a staged relaxation; SIESTA reads .XV / .DM from the previous stage
# (same SystemLabel, same directory).  See the Watch tab's 'Staged relaxation workflow' panel.
# Watch the run live: open the Watch tab and point it at this directory
# (the loader resolves it to siesta-stage3.molwatch.log).
